WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.924 --> 00:00:16.790
"Grr!" Roxy tried to break free.

2
00:00:17.650 --> 00:00:19.011
But the lasso got tighter.

3
00:00:21.011 --> 00:00:22.092
Stinky Bart laughed.

4
00:00:22.112 --> 00:00:24.913
"You'll never get out of my lasso!

5
00:00:25.893 --> 00:00:27.094
It's super strong!"

6
00:00:28.234 --> 00:00:32.396
Whiz-hoo! Roxy fired her eye laser beams at the rope.

7
00:00:33.420 --> 00:00:35.141
The laser beams bounced right off.

8
00:00:36.141 --> 00:00:37.841
"Ugh!" said Roxy.

9
00:00:38.902 --> 00:00:40.262
Stinky Bart laughed again.

10
00:00:40.282 --> 00:00:43.303
"I'll try my heat vision!"

11
00:00:43.543 --> 00:00:44.223
thought Roxy.

12
00:00:45.223 --> 00:00:46.484
She stared at the lasso.

13
00:00:47.464 --> 00:00:49.484
An orange beam radiated from her eyes.

14
00:00:51.965 --> 00:00:53.446
But the rope didn't burn at all.

15
00:00:55.146 --> 00:00:56.566
Stinky Bart laughed again.

16
00:00:56.586 --> 00:00:59.587
"Just give up, Rocket Girl!"

17
00:01:00.488 --> 00:01:04.085
The pretzel man called out, "Fly, Rocket Girl!

18
00:01:04.605 --> 00:01:06.326
The lasso might be stronger than you.

19
00:01:06.866 --> 00:01:08.127
But Stinky Bart isn't!"

20
00:01:09.187 --> 00:01:10.308
Roxy's eyes lit up.

21
00:01:12.029 --> 00:01:13.170
She shot into the air.

22
00:01:16.491 --> 00:01:18.673
Stinky Bart tried to hold on to the lasso.

23
00:01:19.533 --> 00:01:20.934
But it was ripped from his hands.

24
00:01:20.954 --> 00:01:23.775
"No!" cried the cowboy.

25
00:01:25.897 --> 00:01:28.738
Roxy spotted an antenna on top of a skyscraper.

26
00:01:28.758 --> 00:01:31.800
"Perfect!" said Roxy.

27
00:01:32.916 --> 00:01:35.177
She flew over the antenna and then dropped down.

28
00:01:36.458 --> 00:01:38.699
The antenna poked through the knot in the lasso.

29
00:01:40.600 --> 00:01:42.422
Roxy pulled, and the knot came loose.

30
00:01:42.442 --> 00:01:45.083
"Yes!" Roxy cheered.

31
00:01:47.644 --> 00:01:49.886
She took the lasso and flew back down to the street.

32
00:01:50.946 --> 00:01:52.807
Stinky Bart was trying to reach his horse.

33
00:01:53.828 --> 00:01:55.289
But people were blocking his way.

34
00:01:55.309 --> 00:01:59.151
"You're not going to escape, you smelly cowboy!"

35
00:01:59.451 --> 00:02:00.512
shouted the pretzel man.

36
00:02:01.760 --> 00:02:03.061
"Yes, I am!"

37
00:02:03.361 --> 00:02:04.402
shouted Stinky Bart.

38
00:02:07.145 --> 00:02:09.166
"Stop right there, Stinky Bart!"

39
00:02:09.446 --> 00:02:10.207
cried Roxy.

40
00:02:10.227 --> 00:02:12.529
"You're going to jail!"

41
00:02:13.430 --> 00:02:15.271
Roxy swung the lasso over her head.

42
00:02:16.392 --> 00:02:18.914
Shwoosh! She threw it at the cowboy.

43
00:02:19.935 --> 00:02:21.436
Stinky Bart quickly jumped.

44
00:02:22.157 --> 00:02:25.740
Boing! He bounced and landed on top of a parked bus.

45
00:02:26.681 --> 00:02:29.243
"I've got bouncy cowboy boots!"

46
00:02:30.984 --> 00:02:31.985
Stinky Bart laughed.

47
00:02:33.006 --> 00:02:35.528
Roxy started swinging the lasso over her head again.

48
00:02:36.909 --> 00:02:40.772
Boing! Stinky Bart bounced off the bus and toward a big truck.

49
00:02:41.813 --> 00:02:43.034
Roxy threw the lasso.

50
00:02:44.135 --> 00:02:47.618
Shwoosh! It snagged Stinky Bart's leg.

51
00:02:47.638 --> 00:02:49.840
"No!" he cried.

52
00:02:50.541 --> 00:02:52.022
Stinky Bart fell to the street.

53
00:02:53.283 --> 00:02:54.644
Roxy quickly tied him up.

54
00:02:57.367 --> 00:02:58.688
Detective Smith ran over.

55
00:03:00.220 --> 00:03:01.701
"Well done, Rocket Girl!"

56
00:03:01.721 --> 00:03:04.504
"Thanks, Detective," said Roxy.

57
00:03:04.524 --> 00:03:07.266
"You can take him to jail now.

58
00:03:08.187 --> 00:03:11.829
And make sure he gets a shower—he stinks!"

59
00:03:12.930 --> 00:03:14.812
Roxy hurried over to the pretzel stand.

60
00:03:14.832 --> 00:03:17.954
"One pretzel, please."

61
00:03:21.457 --> 00:03:23.859
Roxy got back to the arena and found her friends.

62
00:03:24.960 --> 00:03:27.022
"Sorry that took so long," she said.

63
00:03:28.363 --> 00:03:29.804
Roxy handed out the snacks.

64
00:03:30.900 --> 00:03:33.502
"Thanks for the pretzel, Roxy," said Terrell.

65
00:03:33.522 --> 00:03:36.185
"No problem," said Roxy.

66
00:03:37.005 --> 00:03:38.587
"Rocket Girl helped me get it."

67
00:03:39.708 --> 00:03:41.529
Terrell eyed her suspiciously.

68
00:03:41.549 --> 00:03:43.711
"You're kidding, right?"

69
00:03:43.731 --> 00:03:46.433
"Yep," said Roxy.
